{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST EGGSPEDITION\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=596 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.mp4?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><strong>ENTER THE EGGSPEDITION - A TERRIFYING SURVIVAL HORROR WITH DINOSAURS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 players to explore unknown planets, abandoned facilities, complete missions, and make daring extractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first directive? - Seems simple\u2026 until you open your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been drop-podded onto an uncharted Class X-13 planet. Terrain: dense jungles, jagged mountains, and untouched mineral veins. The catch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s inhabited by\u2026 dinosaurs. Furious, massive, and very much alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One mission. One rule: \u201cNo egg, no evac.\u201d</i><br><i></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EVERY MISSION IS A NEW HELL</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/2e64889460f2736ff90755d41afc53d4.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/2e64889460f2736ff90755d41afc53d4.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what awaits you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you even step out of the drop pod, all you see is the difficulty level. The rest? A complete unknown. One mission might have you extracting rare minerals from an active crater, another \u2014 tracking down a lost egg, or securing a zone crawling with predators.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DANGEROUS ENEMIES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/c167f6f5db4e16c453406e7d3312c210.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/c167f6f5db4e16c453406e7d3312c210.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face bloodthirsty dinosaurs that have evolved to hunt \u2014 and survive. From the swift, cunning velociraptors, striking silently and in packs, to the monumental Tyrannosaurus Rex, a living engine of destruction whose roar can paralyze even the toughest soldier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every predator has its own way of fighting, its own territory, its own method of tearing apart the careless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/4310753e07b1ea48d69c88c93e7ecdf1.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/4310753e07b1ea48d69c88c93e7ecdf1.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in your crew. Only through tight teamwork do you stand a chance of completing the mission \u2014 and making it back in one piece. One scans the terrain, another provides cover, while a third carries the egg under enemy fire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, every move, every decision can mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE &amp; SURVIVE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various abandoned planets. Discover new territories and survive the challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADES &amp; GEAR PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/020ad831a56ec33293ff6dc2146c05ca.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/020ad831a56ec33293ff6dc2146c05ca.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Earn credits and materials to upgrade your arsenal and protective suit. Enhance your weapons, unlock new combat abilities, and equip yourself with essential gadgets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970880?t=1758651939","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970880?t=1758651939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/c5db5ddca4fce393f495feac5ee47a86b8a6ddfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758651939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/c5db5ddca4fce393f495feac5ee47a86b8a6ddfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758651939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST EGGSPEDITION\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=596 height=208 ><source src=\"