pleting the mission \u2014 and making it back in one piece. One scans the terrain, another provides cover, while a third carries the egg under enemy fire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, every move, every decision can mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE &amp; SURVIVE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various abandoned planets. Discover new territories and survive the challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADES &amp; GEAR PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/020ad831a56ec33293ff6dc2146c05ca.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/020ad831a56ec33293ff6dc2146c05ca.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Earn credits and materials to upgrade your arsenal and protective suit. Enhance your weapons, unlock new combat abilities, and equip yourself with essential gadgets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wildflame Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}